## 📝 **Para Jumbles – SSC CGL (PYQ Style)**

### **Question:**

नीचे 4 वाक्य दिए गए हैं। इन्हें सही क्रम में लगाइए ताकि एक अर्थपूर्ण अनुच्छेद बने –

A) It is the responsibility of every citizen to keep their surroundings clean.
B) Cleanliness is not only important for a healthy life but also for the development of a nation.
C) If we keep our environment dirty, it will lead to diseases and poor living conditions.
D) Therefore, we must actively take part in cleanliness drives and spread awareness.

---

### **Step-by-Step Solution:**

1. **Introductory sentence** पहचानें → Cleanliness का महत्व बताया गया है → **(B)**
2. इसके बाद कारण बताना चाहिए कि गंदगी से क्या नुकसान होता है → **(C)**
3. फिर नागरिक की जिम्मेदारी की बात आती है → **(A)**
4. आखिर में निष्कर्ष या सुझाव आता है → **(D)**

---

### ✅ **Correct Order:** **B – C – A – D**

### **Final Paragraph:**

*Cleanliness is not only important for a healthy life but also for the development of a nation. If we keep our environment dirty, it will lead to diseases and poor living conditions. It is the responsibility of every citizen to keep their surroundings clean. Therefore, we must actively take part in cleanliness drives and spread awareness.*

---

